WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.490
- So last time we talked
about surfing in Malibu.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:06.410
So were you there when
the fires got crazy?

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:07.243
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:07.243 --> 00:00:08.430
Yeah, I was working.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:11.240
And I watched on the news as the fire

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.010
was barreling down the PCH
and it was headed straight

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:17.160
for them little tiny
community where I live.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.068
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:18.068 --> 00:00:20.620
- And because of the bravery of 10 men

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.130
who stayed and fought the fire,

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.580
a couple of ex firefighters
and some lifeguards,

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.810
they saved our community

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.660
but my community was completely cut off.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.660
They had one FEMA meal a day

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.810
but they were running out of
gasoline for the generators

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:35.060
'cause there was no power.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:36.630
They were running out of eye wash,

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.585
chocolate, booze, everything.

00:00:38.585 --> 00:00:39.418
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:39.418 --> 00:00:41.070
- All the key things.

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:44.642
- All of the vital components
for survival. Exactly.

00:00:44.642 --> 00:00:45.475
- So yeah.(Kelly chuckles)

00:00:45.475 --> 00:00:46.800
- So I was like, "Okay."

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.350
I'd just gone through a terrible breakup

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:52.080
and was maybe not in
the best frame of mind

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:55.300
but I was like, "I need to deliver goods."

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.133
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:57.800
- However, the only way you
could get in was by boat

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.070
and because people had started looting

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:03.230
the coast guard had issued
a zero ship to shore.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:05.170
So you'd be arrested
if you tried to get in.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:08.420
Nonetheless, I found
a boat and the captain

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.680
and I just had to figure out

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.720
how I was gonna get
the stuff from the boat

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.940
into the beach and I needed some help.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.340
- You became a good pirate.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:16.753
- [Minnie] I did.
- I like it.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:18.863
- I was like,

00:01:18.863 --> 00:01:20.440
"Who can I get to go do this with me?"

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:22.350
So I remember this dude that I'd met

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.710
at a friend's breakfast.

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:27.188
And he was just this really
intrepid Indiana Jones type.

00:01:27.188 --> 00:01:28.021
- Perfect guy.

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:29.690
- Explorer. Called him up.

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:34.020
I was like, "Will you help me
launch a sea-based incursion?

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:36.130
You might get arrested."

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:37.250
- A sea-based incursion?

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.090
- There was a big silence.

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:42.120
And then he was like, "Yeah, I'll do it."

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.470
And we did it.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:44.870
We got chased by the coast guard.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:48.470
We got, there was a
mounted gun on that boat.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:51.920
We had the gasoline balanced
on the paddle boards.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.230
We were paddling it in.

00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:54.510
We dragged it on the beach.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.793
We ran away.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:57.793
The coast guard hung out

00:01:57.793 --> 00:01:59.930
all day waiting for us to come back.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.970
We were shipwrecked in my
house that had no electricity,

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.030
no water, nothing.

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:05.140
And he basically,

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:08.790
I asked him every question
about why men unfaithful,

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:10.550
why men do the things that they do.

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:12.450
I was like, "You are trapped.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:13.710
I'm really sorry.

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:15.220
I wanna ask you a lot of questions."

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:19.090
And he was kind of
like, "Well, all right."

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:19.923
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:02:19.923 --> 00:02:22.040
- And so we hung out the whole day.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.470
I got to know him.

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:26.940
We made it back to the
Marina del Ray at midnight,

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.840
we're standing on the thing.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.180
I was like, "I'm ruined.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.670
I'm never gonna have another boyfriend."

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.310
And he was like, "Well,
I don't want a girlfriend

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:34.700
and definitely not you."

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:35.533
(audience laughing)

00:02:35.533 --> 00:02:37.300
But we stood there.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.360
And then of course we became friends,

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.020
and of course we fell in love.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.714
And of course we've been
together ever since.

00:02:42.714 --> 00:02:43.880
- [Kelly] This is a movie.
(audience clapping)

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:45.300
- [Minnie] Yeah.
- Wait, what?

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.270
That's how it ended?

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.103
- Yeah.

00:02:48.103 --> 00:02:48.936
- That's amazing.

00:02:48.936 --> 00:02:51.250
- He's the greatest person I ever met

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:52.690
apart from my son and my mother.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.765
- Wait, when are you making this movie?

00:02:54.765 --> 00:02:55.943
- [Minnie] I gotta make it into a movie.

00:02:55.943 --> 00:02:56.776
I gotta make it into a movie.

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:58.170
- You gotta make it into a movie.

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.120
- If only I knew some people.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:00.953
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:03:00.953 --> 00:03:01.786
- God. Dang it.

